### App interface.

discord-show-song = Show the song you're playing on your Discord profile.
discord-show-paused = Show when paused
discord-show-paused-desc = Keep the card visible while paused. The timer is hidden in Discord until playback resumes.
discord-hide-details = Hide details
discord-hide-details-desc = Show only that music is playing. No track details, artwork, time or buttons are shared.
discord-status = Discord status
discord-status-text = Status text
discord-status-text-desc = Choose the first line under your name in the member list. The profile card always shows the app's name.
discord-app-name = App name
discord-app-name-desc = Replaces “{ $name }” in Discord. Leave it blank to keep the original.
discord-card = Discord card
discord-card-note = The link beside a line makes it clickable and opens the corresponding item on YouTube Music.
discord-line-one = Line 1
discord-line-two = Line 2
discord-line-three = Line 3
discord-line-one-desc = The bold line, under the header.
discord-line-two-desc = The line below it.
discord-line-three-desc = The last line, also shown when the artwork is hovered. Requires artwork.
discord-clickable = Clickable: { $label }
discord-album-art = Album art
discord-album-art-desc = Show artwork beside the song. Its link opens the album or, if unavailable, the song.
discord-badge = Badge
discord-badge-desc = A small image on the artwork: the artist's photo or the app icon.
discord-time = Time
discord-time-desc = Show playback progress. The full Discord profile shows a progress bar.
discord-buttons = Discord buttons
discord-buttons-note = Only others see up to two buttons. Links appear when available, and Listen together appears only in a session.
discord-buttons-toggle = Buttons
discord-buttons-desc = Show buttons under the card, such as a link to the song on YouTube Music.
discord-first-button = First button
discord-second-button = Second button
discord-song-title = Song title
discord-artist-photo = Artist's picture
discord-you = You
discord-member-list = Member list
discord-profile-card = Profile card
discord-reset = Reset Discord settings to defaults
discord-example = Example
discord-preview-paused = The card is hidden while paused. Turn on Show when paused to keep it visible.
discord-preview-buttons = Only others see the buttons.
discord-listening-to = Listening to { $name }
discord-listen-on-youtube = Listen on YouTube Music
